{"version":1,"content":"<p>這是一款歷經10餘年開發、打磨得近乎完美的史詩級大作。故事圍繞一對戀人展開，他們試圖通過犯罪賺取巨額財富，儘早金盆洗手，追尋屬於罪犯的美國夢。近年來，很少有遊戲像《俠盜獵車手6》（GTA6）這樣備受期待，而它也確實沒有辜負玩家的等待。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587082.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:43:54.886635+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:21:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_hash":"ecf62e5be0878a6035713f90fc2be81a80cd296800b4907958ee031bad950322","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}